{"3084630": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Program Penguin", "steam_appid": 3084630, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Program Penguin is a humorous, tightly paced action-adventure game with an unforgettable cast. Think classic <strong>Zelda</strong> meets <strong>Club Penguin</strong> all rolled up in a classic retro style. An adventure where a tiny penguin explores a corrupted online world filled with strange locals, hidden secrets, and chaotic boss fights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >** <strong>Notice To All Players:</strong> This game contains imagery that may harm players with photosensitive epilepsy or similar conditions. **</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Features:</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, fight and gain new items as you traverse your newly found home. A place with secrets, danger and puns around every corner. Unlock new areas and abilities in Program Penguin, a dense hand-crafted world where you're only as good as the items you found along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Characters:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a cast of unforgettably funny, lazy, dangerous debutantes as you traverse your colorful new home meeting friends, foes and degenerates alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself in an unfamiliar new place known as the Antarctic Server. A cozy place with an unexpected new virus corrupting its inhabitants. Help the peace-loving folks of your newly found home and save the Antarctic Server from this sudden new threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>", "abo